                </h3>
                <p className="text-sm font-bold text-slate-500 tracking-widest uppercase mt-1">
                  Accuracy Score: 
                  <span className={`ml-2 text-base ${feedback.isPerfect ? 'text-emerald-600' : 'text-rose-500'}`}>
